          "help": "A blank line starts a new paragraph.",
          "default": "The Hindu Kush Himalaya is the world’s “Third Pole” — storing the largest volume of ice outside the Arctic and Antarctic. It feeds 10 major river systems across Asia.\n\nWhen Himalayan glaciers retreat, water security across South Asia is destabilized — affecting agriculture, cities, biodiversity, and regional stability."
